# Draggable Panel — a floating "Spring Animations" panel that can be dragged
# anywhere and, on release, springs (with the release velocity projected) to
# the nearest of four corners; the spring used is picked in the panel
# (Elegant / Springy / Super, colours interpolated), and the X collapses it to
# a 64pt round button (layout transition, FadeIn/FadeOut) that is draggable
# too and expands back on tap.
# What this test covers: every spring type, drags to all four corners with
# each spring, a short drag that snaps back to the same corner, a fast fling
# across the screen (velocity projection), collapsing in a corner and
# re-snapping to the collapsed size, dragging the collapsed button around and
# expanding it, re-grabbing the panel mid-spring, and rapid option taps.
# Expanded 280x150 corners: TL(30,80) TR(92,80) BL(30,624) BR(92,624);
# inside: Elegant +58,+94, Springy +139,+94, Super +221,+94, X +244,+35.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/draggable-panel"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "text" "Spring Animations" 30000
wait 1000
# Springy, then drag BR -> TR.
press 231 718
wait 500
gesture pan 200 660 0 -500 600
wait 1500
# Super (panel at TR), then drag TR -> BL.
press 313 212
wait 500
gesture pan 200 153 -150 520 600
wait 2000
# Short drag: back to BL.
gesture pan 120 660 40 -60 500
wait 1500
# Fast fling up-right with Super spring (velocity projected).
gesture pan 120 660 120 -150 120
wait 2000
# Elegant, then back to BR.
press 150 212
wait 500
gesture pan 200 153 0 520 600
wait 1500
# Re-grab mid-spring.
gesture pan 200 660 -150 0 300
wait 150
gesture pan 120 660 120 0 300
wait 1500
# Wherever that landed (BL or BR), push it to BR.
gesture pan 150 660 250 0 600
wait 1500
# Rapid option taps (panel at BR).
press 231 718
wait 80
press 313 718
wait 80
press 150 718
wait 80
press 231 718
wait 800
# Collapse with X: the 64pt button snaps to the nearest corner for its new
# size, which is bottom-left (centre 62,742).
press 336 659
wait 1500
# Drag the collapsed button to BR, half-way up and back down (snaps BR), then
# back to BL, and tap it to expand. (Top corners sit under the demo's Close
# button / the debug gear, so they are avoided.)
gesture pan 62 742 278 0 600
wait 1500
gesture pan 340 742 0 -200 600
wait 1500
gesture pan 340 742 -278 0 600
wait 1500
press 62 742
wait 1500
wait "text" "Spring Animations" 8000
# Back to the bottom-right corner, clear of the demo's top buttons.
gesture pan 200 660 150 0 600
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
